# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# Cloudflare Pages serves `out/` statically and, unlike the Next.js Node
# server, does not resolve extensionless URLs to their `.html` file for
# client-side route prefetches. Without these rules, every client-side
# navigation logs a 404 for the RSC payload before falling back to a full
# page load. The links work either way - these just stop the noise.

/projects/:slug /projects/:slug.html 200
/projects/:slug/ /projects/:slug.html 200